{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Bounty Dog","In the future, mankind has colonized the bleak expanses of the moon. Cities now stand proudly where there was once only desolation and emptiness. But there are alien forces that do not want mankind to succeed and only one man can stop them. He is a member of the Bounty Dog Investigation Unit, a high-tech cybernetic mercenary team."],"ja":["バウンティドッグ~月面のイブ~",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-1811","ids":{"shikimori":1811,"mal":1811,"anilist":1811,"kodik":"serial-48559"},"kodikIds":["serial-20146","serial-48559"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-20146":"2019-12-09T20:54:20Z","serial-48559":"2023-01-26T09:22:09Z"},"title":"Баунти Дог","originalTitle":"Bounty Dog: Getsumen no Ibu","alt":"Баунти Дог - OVA Bounty Dog バウンティドッグ~月面のイブ~","description":"Лунная колония в недалёком будущем. На Луне спит небожительница, которой, возможно, несколько тысяч лет. Сотрудники крупной корпорации исследуют это неземное существо и опасаются, что Спящая может уничтожить Землю. Тем временем на Луну прибывает команда наёмников, один из которых был влюблён в клона Спящей, попавшего на Землю и погибшего там...","year":1994,"type":"OVA","genres":["Экшен","Фантастика","космос"],"rating":5.66,"popularity":1754,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/1811/ad6c6f101ba786cd6b904bb998717296.jpeg","width":565,"height":755},"backdrop":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1811-eOduWgtMaSio.jpg","width":480,"height":360}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-767","dubId":"767","label":"SHIZA Project","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-20146","translationId":"767","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/538637/689983191980847ca38867f403095e25